+config BATTERY_APPLE_HDQ
+	tristate "Apple iPad mini 1 battery gauge (bq27540 on HDQ over UART)"
+	depends on ARCH_APPLE_S5L || COMPILE_TEST
+	help
+	  The iPad mini 1's bq27540 gas gauge, read over its one-wire HDQ bus
